; Under fire (@OP_Swim, underwater ballistics): the player in ~5.5 m of water off the Everon bay beach, in god mode
; (allowDamage false: no hit, blast or drowning hurts him); four East riflemen on the beach 24 m away fire into the
; water around him and grenades drop in near him. Dive with Z to watch the rounds and the blasts from below.
; The fire is scripted (fire.sqs, grenade.sqs): the AI would not shoot at a diver it cannot see.
setViewDistance 1500
player allowDamage false
player setPos [9950, 1482, 0]
player setDir 0
player switchCamera "EXTERNAL"
{_x disableAI "MOVE"; _x setUnitPos "UP"; [_x] exec "fire.sqs"} forEach [e1, e2, e3, e4]
g1 disableAI "MOVE"
g1 setUnitPos "UP"
[g1] exec "grenade.sqs"
~2
hint "Under fire (god mode): riflemen on the beach shoot into the water around you and grenades drop in near you. Z dives, Q comes up, W swims."
exit
